#: processes/publish-verification.bpmn:33
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Run the verifier set (scripts/publish-verify.ts, `bun run publish:verify -- --dir <site>`) over the built tree. A SET: each verifier is one entry, and adding one changes nothing else. The first is JSON-LD expansion under a real processor, network refused — a property the context does not declare, a relative IRI or a context that will not load is a finding. Only documents of OURS are verified; third-party data in the tree is counted and cannot block."
msgstr ""

#: processes/publish-verification.bpmn:18
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs every verifier over the exported documents before anything is deployed, and reports pass, fail or could-not-tell. It decides nothing about the release: the caller blocks on anything but a pass."
msgstr ""

